        "cooked": "<p>Yesterday, as we were preparing to carve pumpkins, the Grasshopper (which is the nom d'Internet for my son who turned 8 today) drew <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/image/1812643\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>. I then had to explain to him that Sentinel comics didn't really exist, but that their \"existence\" was one of the miracles of SotM.</p><p>AZ is one of his favorite heroes to play, if not his favorite.</p>",
